CreateSegmenter calls mozilla::intl::GetDataProvider(), which is only
declared with MOZ_ICU4X. Its callers are already guarded, but the
template itself is not, and GCC 15+ rejects the non-dependent name even
though the template is never instantiated (-Wtemplate-body).

